                "description": "Either the Test Suites' ID or its unique name"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Upserts a new test case for a test suite, keying off of the optionally provided test case id.\n\nIf an id is provided and has a match, the test case will be updated. If no id is provided or no match\nis found, a new test case will be appended to the end.\n\nNote that a full replacement of the test case is performed, so any fields not provided will be removed\nor overwritten with default values."
        },
